# The pod scripts are authored on Windows and executed on Linux.  A shell script
# committed with CRLF fails there on its first line with a bare `$'\r': command
# not found`, which on a rented pod means paying for a machine that never starts
# the job.  Force LF in the repository regardless of the checkout's autocrlf.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
